�Και λοιπόν; :Πώς να Επικοινωνείτε αυτό που έχει σημασία στο Ακροατήριό σας"�
�Basizomenos se perissoteres apo saranta sunenteuxeis pou parakhorese o Steve Jobs se diastema duo eton -kathos kai se sunomilies me perissoterous apo ekato suggeneis, philous, antipalous, antagonistes kai sunergates-, o Walter Isaacson kathelonei ton anagnoste me te sunarpastike istoria tes zoes enos demiourgikou epikheirematia, o opoios, me to pathos tou gia ten teleioteta kai ten aparamille egetike tou deinoteta, ephere epanastase se exi diaphoretikous tomeis tes biomekhanias: tous elektronikous upologistes, tis tainies kinoumenon skhedion, te mousike, ten telephonia, tous upologistes aphes kai tis psephiakes ekdoseis.
O Steve Jobs ensarkone to protupo tou epheuretikou, protoporou epikheirematia pou gnorize polu kala pos na axiopoiei te duname tes phantasias. Katorthose na sunduasei te demiourgike skepse me ten tekhnognosia kai oikodomese mia etaireia-kolosso, sto plaisio tes opoias ta almata tes phantasias suntonizontan me ta thaumata tes tekhnologias.
Parolo pou o Jobs sunergasteke gia te suggraphe autou tou bibliou, de zetese na elegxei to periekhomeno tou - oute kan na to diabasei protou ekdothei. Den ethese kanenan periorismo. Antithetos, entharrune tous anthropous pou milesan gi' auton na ekphrastoun eleuthera. Kai o idios, exallou, mila eilikrina, eniote oma, gia tous sunergates kai tous antagonistes tou. Oi philoi, oi ekhthroi kai oi sunadelphoi tou katathetoun te marturia tous gia ta pathe, ten teleiomania, tis emmones tou, ten aphosiose tou sto ergo tou, alla kai to sugkentrotismo tou, o opoios kathorise ton tropo douleias tou.
Me tous prosopikous tou daimones na ton katadiokoun diarkos, o Jobs sukhna othouse tous guro tou sten apelpisia. Ostoso, e prosopikoteta kai to ergo tou den mporoun na diakhoristoun* deikhnoun na leitourgoun san ena olokleromeno, eniaio sustema, akribos opos to hardware kai to software tes Apple. E istoria tou parekhei paradeigmata pros apophuge kai pros mimese eno, ten idia stigme, prospherei mathemata gia to kainotomo pneuma, te duname tou kharaktera, te semasia ton prosopikon axion."�
�Librarian's Note: this is translated edition - ISBN 13: 9781935944867
To Mikro Probadismaeinai tropos skepses, enas tropos epexergasias plerophorion, o opoios sas kathista ikanous na pairnete kathemerines apophaseis pou tha sas odegesoun sten epitukhia pou epithumeite."�
�To pleres keimeno tes Odusseias tou Omerou se metaphrase tou Zesimou Sidere kai eisagoge kai ermeneutikes semeioseis tes Elenes Kakride.
To keimeno akolouthei to diakhorismo stis 24 Rapsodies pou orisan oi Alexandrinoi mesa apo tis opoies zoume ton peripeteiode nosto tou polumekhanou Odussea, alla kai to drama tes oikogeneias tou pou to anemene gia deka oloklera khronia apo te lexe tou Troikou polemou.
Polloi gnostoi ki agapemenoi eroes pou kharazoun tis psukhes olou tou planete, o Odusseas, e piste suzugos Penelope, o nearos gios Telemakhos, e Athena os Mentor, alla kai apo tous "kakous" oi Laistrugones kai oi Kuklopes, e Kirke, e Kalupso, oi Seirenes, e Skula kai e Kharubdis, oi mnesteres kai tosoi alloi pou megalonoun akome genies kai orizoun te skepse kai to logo mas.
Oloi mesa apo to epos tou Omerou pou akome mas empneei na men egkataleipoume to taxidi mas mekhri na phtasoume telika sten Ithake."�
�Sto "Poioi einai oi STOKhOI sou;", o suggrapheas Gary Ryan Blair parousiazei mia olistike, olokleromene proseggise gia na kathorisete auto pou epithumeite apo te zoe sas. Mesa apo dieisdutikes, stokheumenes, bathies eroteseis, o Blair apokaluptei ena monopati bema pros bema se olous, etsi oste na geutoume mia zoe entones aistheses tou skopou, gemate isorropemenous stokhous. E sophia kai e duname auton ton eroteseon, tha sas dosei te duname na axiopoiesete tis eukairies pou tha demiourgethoun mesa apo tis dikes sas apanteseis."�
�Sto biblio auto o Allan Pease katagraphei, gia prote phora, mia apo tis pleon axiosemeiotes tekhnikes pou skhetizontai me to Diktuako Marketingk. Khresimopoiontas aples, dokimasmenes sten praxe tekhnikes kai taktikes, tha mathete pos na domesete ten epikheirese sas se ena epipedo pera ki apo ta pio trela sas oneira. To paron biblio tha sas deixei pos na epitukhete gia ole sas te zoe ena koruphaio eisodema."�
�Ena uperokho kai khresimo biblio gia ten katanoese kai te beltiose ton skheseon anamesa se zeugaria. To "Prosopikoteta Sun gia Zeugaria" tha sas boethesei na xeperasete tis sugkrouseis prosopikoteton kai na ektimesete ta monadika kharismata pou diathetei o suntrophos sas kai eseis!"�
�Na ten loipon te Subaritissa mou etoime na ten agapesete opos kai go. Ten kuophorousa tria khronia kai eikosi epta aiones ospou ten eida na gennietai stous kepous tes Subares. Keines tes apoikias ton Akhaion apo tis protes pou anastethekan sta notia tes Italias guro sta 725 p.Kh. Mia pole-kratos pamploute, demokratike, me eirenophile suneidese ki eutukhismeno lao. Pole likhouda, laimarge, philedone, philomouse, gemate sebasmo gia ten eleutheria ton anthropon kai tous polites gematous sebasmo gia ton plesion tous. Ekei anakalupsa ten panagne tes eleutherias Elene asemadeute akome, prin ten katakhorisei o Esiodos stous enokhous giati gennetheke gunaika. Aneggikhte apo te misallodoxia tou antrikou ratsismou giati aute genna. Prin o phonikos Drakon katadikasei ten autodiathese tou somatos tes baphtizontas ten moikheia kai plastographethei e polugamike Penelope me tous saranta erastes sten aneraste uphantra tou epous."�
�To biblio ekhei kalumma exophullo to kokkino kai to aspro einai to kanoniko tes bibliodesias opos ole e seira.
