�Gia anthropous pou khairontai na boethoun tous anthropous.
Oi oktos mustikes axies tes epikheirematikes drasteriotetas tou diktuakou marketingk, pera apo ta khremata.
E skhole ton epikheiremation tou Plousiou Mpampagia anthropous pou khairontai na boeoun tous Anthropoustha sas apokalupsei ton takhutero tropo na khtisete mia epikheirese sto tetartemorio ton "E". Giati o oros "diktuo" khairei ektimeses stous kuklous ton plousion."�
�Mia sunarpastike parabole gia ten aeikinete, anesukhe epokhe mas, pou diadramatizetai ste khora tes phantasias. Paramuthi kai pragmatikoteta sunama, torine kai mellontike, gemate erotematika pou antikathrephtizontai stis morphes kai ta pepromena, na ti einai e istoria tes Momo. Mesa ap' ta matia enos mikrou koritsiou, tes trupheres, gennaias alla kai apophasistikes Momo, o kosmos mas phainetai kai semera plousios se thaumata kai musteria oso kai se perasmenes epokhes. Ki o khronos pou kula, einai o megaluteros ploutos mas, einai e zoe kai e zoe zei mesa sten kardia. Einai to zontano sumbolo pou epikuronei ten anagke tou anthropou n' agonistei gia o,ti anthropino uparkhei mesa tou."�
�To biblio auto tha sas boethesei na auxesete ten paragogikoteta sas se olous tous tomeis tes zoes sas - alla okhi kai ston tropo skepses sas. Den tha breite ena <>gia ten epitukhia sas* tha ekhete omos te mia spoudaia idea na diadekhetai ten alle, ki auto tha kanei to mualo na kinethei demiourgika me tropous pou tha sas kanoun na peite polles phores <>ten ora pou tha diamorphonete ton diko sas, prosopiko <>gia ten epitukhia.
Gia pano apo dekaetia o Binsent Kharis paramenei koruphaios proponetes kai mentoras se anotata stelekhe, athletes kai atoma pou epizetoun to kati parapano apo te zoe tous.
E paragogike empneuse graphteke gia na skalisei to mualo sas kai na sas prospherei ola osa khreiazeste prokeimenou na:
Peithete ton eauto sas kai tous allous na analambanoun drase
Bionete megalutere eutukhia
Demiourgeite skheseis pou na antekhoun perissotero
Olokleronete perissotera se ligotero khrono
Kai polla perissotera!
Apo to opisthophullo"�
�Phantasteite oti eiste kapou sto dromo, sto spiti sas, sten douleia sas kai xaphnika emphanizontai apo to pouthena duo tupoi mprosta sas. O enas einai pselos, terastios me aspra mallia kai geneiada, enas kalokagathos gerontas kai o allos mikrokamomenos, neurikos me ena ponero khamogelo. Meta to proto sok kai eno prospatheite akoma na sunelthete apo to paralogo tes emphanises, sas sustenontai os Theos kai Satanas. Pos tha antidrousate;"�
�Γίνε Ήρωας: Τρεις αποτελεσματικοί τρόποι για να υπερνικήσεις τις προκλήσεις στην εργασία και τη ζωή"�
�Librarian's Note: this is translated edition - ISBN 13: 9781605090009
GINE O EROAS POU PANTA EThELES NA GINEIS!
Kata kairous, oloi mas niothoume apogoeteumenoi, agkhomenoi e oti ekhoume khasei ton elegkho. Den tha etan apithano na mporeis na briskesai sten kalutere sou phorma otan oi prokleseis gigantonontai; Ki omos, ginetai. To <>mas eisagei sten ennoia tou <>kai mas deikhnei pos na metatrepoume tis autokatastrophikes skepseis kai ten ettopathe sumperiphora se eroike stase. To tekhnasma brisketai stis istories pou aphegoumaste ston eauto mas.
Kath' ole te diarkeia tes emeras, khoris kan na to suneidetopoioume, aphegoumaste dekades istories ston eauto mas - skhetika me allous anthropous, guro apo tis katastaseis pou bionoume kai anaphorika me ton eauto mas - istories pou diamorphonoun ta sunaisthemata kai te sumperiphora mas. Oi istories autes einai toso iskhures oste mas kanoun na skephtomaste kai na energoume eite os eroes eite os thumata. To <>sou apokaluptei pos na epilegeis tis istories pou odegoun sten prosopike kai epaggelmatike epitukhia.
Akolouthontas ten paradose ton kaluteron aphegeton kai paramuthadon, o Noe Mploumental plekei enan mutho toso sageneutiko oso kai bathustokhasto. To <>einai proorismeno na ginei klasiko sto eidos tou.
Kathos stekotan sten koruphe enos elbetikou bounou, o Tzeph nomize oti eikhe brei to mustiko gia na zesei mia uperokhe zoe. Okto khronia argotera, etan to anerkhomeno asteri tes etaireias tou kai anemene te gennese tou protou tou paidiou. Tote omos ola arkhisan na katarreoun. Akoloutheste ton sto ekplektiko taxidi tou, kathos anakaluptei ti tou xephuge otan briskotan sten koruphe tou bounou kai pos tha epanaktesei ten epitukhia ste zoe kai sten ergasia."�
�"Den ethela na skotoso kanena, all' auto den empodise na skotoso treis!... Sto dikasterio athootheka ki o kosmos mou 'rixe dikio...". Ena biblio gia kathe anthropo, kathe elikias. Ena ergo dunaton aisthematon kai sunekhon sugkrouseon. Ena muthistorema apo ta kalutera tes ellenikes pezographias, pou sugklonizoun ten kardia mas."�
�Einai sklero alla alethino to gegonos oti oi anthropoi me tous opoious prospathoume na epikoinonesoume, na tous poulesoume e na tous peisoume gia kati, den noiazontai gia mas. Oute noiazontai gi' auto pou tous prospheroume mekhri na katanoesoun akribos pos tha epophelethoun apo auto. An anagnorisoume aute ten ome, sklere aletheia, tha kerdisoume perissotera khremata, tha petukhoume perissotera pragmata kai tha diaskedazoume perissotero, mas diabebaionei o pagkosmios gnostos sumboulos poleseon Mark Magnacca sto neo tou biblio. Mesa apo tis selides tou mathainoume pos na apantame euphuos sten erotese <>kathe phora, anexarteta apo to poios mas rota e to ti prospathoume na petukhoume. To biblio einai bebaio pos tha metamorphosei ton tropo me ton opoio epikoinonoume gia na petukhainoume toso stis epikheireseis mas oso kai ste zoe mas!"�
�Eiste thumomenoi me te diaphthora ston etairiko kosmo; Me to khrematisterio kai tis megales trapezes; Me to kratos pou kanei polla lathos pragmata kai liga sosta; E... mepos eiste thumomenoi me ton eauto sas pou den analabate ton elegkho ton oikonomikon sas noritera;
E zoe einai sklere. To erotema einai: Ti prokeitai na kanete gi' auto;
An thelete plouto, prepei na ton demiourgesete. Prepei na kathorisete eseis to mellon sas elegkhontas ten pege eisodematos sas -semera!
Khreiazeste te dike sas epikheirese kai auto to biblio tha sas deixei pos na te demiourgesete!
Mporei oi kairoi na einai oikonomika duskoloi gia tous perissoterous, omos gia pollous epikheirematies einai mia periodos gemate oikonomikes eukairies. Okhi mono erthe e ora na apoktesete te dike sas epikheirese, alla den uperxe pote kalutere stigme!
Apo to opisthophullo."�
�Smurne. Tele tou 19ou aiona.
E odusseia duo oikogeneion mesa sto khrono. Tourkoi kai Ellenes se mia diadrome me anapanteta erotematika kai moiraies apokalupseis.
Athena. Tele tou 20ou aiona.
Enas demosiographos kai o adelphos tou anazetoun ten aletheia gia ten katagoge tous, sta taragmena khronia tou Ellenotourkikou polemou tou '97 kai tes Katastrophe tou '22: to mustiko tes zoes kai tes exaphanises tou giatrou Platona Peleide.
E Smurne apheteria kai lutrotikos proorismos kai e Athena, e Konstantinoupole, e Agkura kai e Thessalonike endiamesoi stathmoi, stis laburinthodeis periplaneseis ton phantastikon eroon alla kai ton gnoston istorikon prosopon pou emplekontai ste drase: o Eleutherios Benizelos kai o Demetrios Gounares, o Georgios kai o Konstantinos, o Ioannes Metaxas kai o Paulos Melas, O Ion Dragoumes kai o Manoles Kalomoires.
To koubari tes mnemes xetuligetai lutrotika apokaluptontas aletheies kai muthous, mise kai pathe, politikes diamakhes kai intrigkes, to taragmeno parelthon ton duo laon.
Mia muthistorematike epopoiia, to proto meros tes trilogias "Epistrophe ste Smurne"."�
�Neo kausimo
Gia anthropous kai omades pou stokheuoun sten koruphe
Aisthaneste merikes phores oti ekhete baltosei; Oti ekhete meinei stasimoi; Oti den semeionete kamia proodo; Einai polu eukolo na apodosoume te stasimoteta mas sta empodia pou emphanizontai ston dromo mas, stis duskolies pou antimetopizoume e sten oikonomike krise.
Ostoso, o pragmatikos logos pou pephtoun oi epidoseis mas einai giati mas leipei e pneumatike energeia.
Panta tha uparkhoun problemata. E epitukhia erkhetai otan ekhoume arketa kausima gia na ta xeperasoume. Diabaste auto to biblio, epharmoste tis arkhes pou proteinei kai tha ephodiasete ton eauto sas kai ten omada sas me arketa kausima oste na stokheusete kai na phtasete sten koruphe!"�
�"O Tzim antilambanetai ten epitukhia, ten prosopike anaptuxe kai ten egesia me enan spanio tropo. Kai aute e bathia gnose ton ekhei boethesei na demiourgesei enan apo tous apotelesmatikoterous epikheirematikous organismous ston kosmo. "E Strategike tes Epitukhias" apotelei ena exokho plano gia ten prosopike sas anaptuxe, epeide pairnei trianta khronia peiras kai gnoses kai ta apokrustallonei se ena eukolodiabasto, epitomo ergo."
apo ton prologo tou John Maxwell"�
�To biblio Otan o Adam ta tsougkrise me ten Eua exegei merika apo ta themata pou mperdeuoun tous antres kai tis gunaikes stis metaxu tous skheseis edo kai aiones. Apo to zapingk mekhri to anebasmeno kathisma tes toualetas, apo ten epikoinonia mekhri ta psonia, oi eidikoi ton skheseon Allan kai Barbara Pease sas deikhnoun pos mporeite na antleite perissotere ikanopoiese apo tis skheseis sas kai pos na katalabainete te sumperiphora tou suntrophou sas!
* Giati oi antres lene psemata;
* Giati koitazoun alles gunaikes;
* Poia einai ta epta pragmata pou trelainoun perissotero tis gunaikes;
* Giati gkriniazoun oi gunaikes;
* Giati oi gunaikes klaine perissotero apo tous antres;
* Ti anazetoun oi antres se mia gunaika, toso gia mia ephemere gnorimia oso kai gia mia makroprothesme skhese;
Apo tous suggrapheis tou #1 diethnous best-seller Ma giati den me katalabaineis; ena biblio pou apantaei me khioumoristike diathese se ola osa mas apaskholoun stis skheseis mas me to allo phulo."�
�Pote xekina o ellenikos politismos; Pos mporoume na orisoume methodologika ten apheteria tou kai na ten entopisoume ston khrono; Se poious khronous kai se poies diadikasies mporei na anakhthei e proeleuse tou ellenismou ton istorikon khronon; To kuriotero: pou mporoume na broume, os mesoi Ellenes anagnostes, upeuthunes apanteseis se erotemata toso semantika kai euaistheta, makria apo epikindunes uperaplousteuseis kai akraies ideolepsies, apo muthomaneis <>khondroeidous erasitekhnismou e eniote kai amphiboles psukhopneumatikes isorropias;
To biblio apotelei ena epistemoniko oso kai suggraphiko egkheirema. Leitourgei katarkhas os ena sustematiko kai prosito egkheiridio tes makrokhronias, diethnous epistemonikes diereuneses ton aparkhon tou ellenikou politismou. Sto plaisio auto epikairopoiei drastika tis gnoseis tou euruterou endiapheromenou koinou sten Ellada me dedomene ten alethine kosmogonia pou ta teleutaia 25 peripou khronia ekhei suntelestei se diethnes epipedo toso sten melete tes proeleuses ton glosson oso kai sten skhese metaxu tes arkhaiologias, tes glossologias, alla kai allon emplekomenon epistemon. Oi polles kai diaphoretikes theories pou ekhoun diatupothei sten diethne epistemonike koinoteta peri tes <>taxinomountai kata khronika parathura, parousiazontai analutika kai skholiazontai kata ton pleon diexodiko, alla kai eulepto tropo. Mesa apo ena basiko phrontisterio tes proistorias tou Aigaiou, alla kai enos euruterou geographikou khorou ginetai katanoete e sunthete istoria tes ereunas tou problematos, kathos kai to upobathro ton neon, anatreptikon porismaton, sta opoia aute katalegei.
Stis selides tou bibliou o omerikos Odusseas, e <>ton Dorieon, oi musteriodeis Pelasgoi, oi grammikes graphes kai ta poluarithma mnemeia tes proistorias tou Aigaiou einai merika monon apo ta kommatia enos megalou kai poluplokou pazl, to opoio apokaluptetai siga siga dinontas nees, upeuthunes kai anapantekhes apanteseis se mia seira apo sunthetes, alla kai sunarpastikes eroteseis. Apomenei na katadeikhthei kata poson mia diaphainomene, rizike metabole tes antilepses gia to parelthon mporei na odegesei kai sten allage diaphoron edraiomenon kateuthunseon pou aphoroun to paron kai to mellon okhi monon tes Elladas, alla kai tes Europes."�
�Beltioste te zoe sas epharmozontas tis deka arkhes tou bibliou "Pos na ginetai o anthropos pou anekathen oneireuosastan".
- Potiste tous sporous tou megaleiou sas
- Pote men ta paratesete me to proto "okhi" pou tha akousete
- Metatrepste ta mikra bemata se terastia almata
- Kante Thetikes skepseis
- Sunodepste ta oneira sas me praxeis
- Ksepleroste o,ti daneistekate
- Deixte eugeneia se peisma ton duskolion tes zoes
kai akoma perissotera ...
Apo to opisthophullo tou bibliou."�
�Ti entupose aphenoume stous anthropous sten prote sunantese; Se mia epaggelmatike sunenteuxe; Sto proto rantebou; Se mia semantike koinonike ekdelose; To paikhnidi ton proton entuposeon einai polu krisimo, ki ekhoume mono mia eukairia na to kerdisoume. Epaggelmatikes, philikes kai erotikes skheseis sterionoun e nauagoun analoga me ten prote entupose. Ki omos, oi perissoteroi den xeroume pos mas blepoun oi alloi.
E Ann Demarais kai e Valerie White, sumbouloi se polles apo tis 100 epikheireseis tou periodikou Fortune diatuponoun protaseis gia na proballoume ton kalutero eauto mas se kathe nea gnorimia, sten epaggelmatike kai koinonike mas zoe. Diaphotistiko, diaskedastiko alla kai epistemonika tekmeriomeno, me kanones autoaxiologeses kai praktika paradeigmata, to biblio apotelei enan aparaiteto odego gia ten pio semantike stigme kathe skheses: ten prote."�
�Apo ton prologo tou Tom Kantrel
"Den einai polu endiapheron pou ena takhudaktulourgos egrapss biblio gia to pos na men exapatomaste;
Einai polu eukolo na exapateeis. Eimaste oloi epirrepeis. Einai semantiko na to katalaboume auto. O Ainstain elege: "E katanoese tes phuses enos problematos apotelei to miso tes luses tou".
Epomenos, auto oto biblio ekhei na kanei perissotero me ten katanoese ton problematon para me ten aneurese luseon. Tha katalexeis sti dikes sou luseis, auto einai skhetika eukolo. Kapoios rotese kapote ton emgalo Kharru Khountini pos ebgale ton lago apo to kapelo. Ekeinos apantese: "Den uparkhei kanena truk ston na bgaleis to lago ap' to kapelo. To pragmatiko truk einai na ton kataphereis na mpei mesa se auto".
Ara to pragmatiko truk truk einai na katalaboume pos demiourgountai kai diaionizontai ta problemata mas. Otan katalaboume ton tropo me ton opoio exapatomste, tote ekhoume te duname na apagkistrothoume apo tis pseudaistheseis kai tis parermeneies pou odegoun se prosopikes, pneumatikes koinonikes kai epaggelmatikes kriseis.
Otan to katapheroume auto, ekhoume phtasei sten eleutheria""�
�Poio einai to mustiko gia ten oikonomike epitukhia;
Na bgazeis enan skasmo lephta;
Na epilegeis tis kaluteres metokhes e amoibaia kephalaia;
Na dineis emphase sta omologa os protarkhiko ependutiko okhema;
Na ependueis se akineta;
Na topotheteis ta khremata sou se asphaleis trapezikous logariasmous;
Tha se aiphnidiaze an mathaines pos e soste apantese einai
KANENA APO TA PARAPANO;
E istoria aute apokaluptei pos den uparkhei magike suntage e kapoio mustiko gia ten oikonomike epitukhia.
To pragmatiko mustiko periekhetai stis selides tou biblio kai einai toso eukolo oste o kathenas mporei na to kanei praxe."�
�Με τι είπαμε ότι ασχολείσαι;: Ο πληρέστερος οδηγός πειστικής επικοινωνίας & ακαταμάχητης αυτοπαρουσίασης στην ψηφιακή εποχή"�
�E Epidexioteta me tous anthropous einai to pio kala amoibomeno apo ola ta anthropina talenta.
E epidexioteta sou stis sunallages sou me tous allous kathorizei ten poioteta tes Epaggelmatikes sou Zoes, tes Oikogeneiakes sou Zoes, tes Koinonikes sou Zoes.
E Gnose kai oi tekhnikes pou tha breis se auto to egkheiridio tha beltiosoun polu ten epidexioteta sou sten epaphe me ton kosmo.
Khresimopoiese tes!
Eimai eutukhes pou se boetho se auton ton toso zotiko tomea.
Kale tukhe!
Les Giblin"�
�O titlos ta leei ola mia pragmatike, suntome epitome tes istorias tes ellenikes glossas.
Ksekinontas apo to 1.400p.Kh. kai dianuontas 5 diaphoretikes periodous glossikes istorias, sigoura blepoume te glossa mas me allo mati sto telos."�	
�	In this remarkable and provocative book, Yanis Varoufakis explodes the myth that financialisation, ineffectual regulation of banks, greed and globalisation were the root causes of the global economic crisis. Rather, they are symptoms of a much deeper malaise which can be traced all the way back to the Great Crash of 1929, then on through to the 1970s: the time when a 'Global Minotaur' was born. Just as the Athenians maintained a steady flow of tributes to the Cretan beast, so the 'rest of the world' began sending incredible amounts of capital to America and Wall Street. Thus, the Global Minotaur became the 'engine' that pulled the world economy from the early 1980s to 2008.
Today's crisis in Europe, the heated debates about austerity versus further fiscal stimuli in the US, the clash between China's authorities and the Obama administration on exchange rates are the inevitable symptoms of the weakening Minotaur; of a global 'system' which is now as unsustainable as it is imbalanced. Going beyond this, Varoufakis lays out the options available to us for reintroducing a modicum of reason into a highly irrational global economic order.
An essential account of the socio-economic events and hidden histories that have shaped the world as we now know it."�

�
Osa prepei na gnorizei kathe stelekhos marketingk gia na kanei khresimes gnorimies kai na kleinei epaggelmatika rantebou.
Karpos eikosakhrones empeirias, o diaphotistikos autos odegos perilambanei polutimes plerophories, sugkhrones strategikes kai tis pleon exeligmenes tekhnikes pou anatrepoun tis paradosiakes, sumbatikes methodous poleseon.
Akolouthontas tis sumboules tou demophilous Amerikanou suggraphea Michael J. Durkin, tou anthropou pou ekhei ekpaideusei khiliades stelekhe epikheireseon ta teleutaia khronia, tha katapherete na dieurunete tis epaggelmatikes sas epaphes, na beltiosete ten epaggelmatike sas eikona kai na auxesete theamatika tis poleseis sas.
Metaxu allon, sto biblio auto tha mathete:
* Pos na proseggizete gregora kai exupna upopsephious sunergates parakamptontas tukhon empodia pou tha akurosoun ten prospatheia sas.
* Pos na kerdizete ten eunoia tou sunomilete sas kai na kleinete amesa epaggelmatika rantebou.
* Pos na diabazete te <>glossa tou somatos tou upopsephiou sunergate sas, etsi oste na katalabainete pote einai e katallele stigme gia na zetesete to telephono e ten elektronike tou dieuthunse.
* Poso kala proetoimasmenoi prepei na eiste protou kanete ta telephonemata sas.
* Pos na anaptuxete tis aparaitetes dexiotetes gia na petukhete sto diktuako marketingk.
To anatreptiko biblio gia to marketingk tou 21ou aiona pou tha apogeiosei ten kariera sas!"�	
�Einai e istoria sou... Peistike ki Akatamakhete;
Pote den einai e katallele stigme gia na kaneis mia kake parousiase. Pare ton elegkho tou prosopikou sou menumatos ki anakalupse to pos mporeis na epitukheis pragmatike epaphe. Auto pou sou mathainei to paron biblio einai kati parapano apo aplos ena dilepto logudrio* einai e methodos epikoinonias tes psephiakes epokhes. Eite to grapheis sto twitter eite to les dia zoses, auto pou ekheis na peis prepei na einai dunato... eidallos khanetai mesa ston thorubo.
Edo loipon sas dinetai to polutimo egkheiridio pou sas epitrepei na demiourgesete mia akatamakhete kai authentike epaphe me tous anthropous pou ekhoun te megalutere semasia gia esas.
Ston kosmo tou Web 2.0 den einai pleon mustiko oti oi epaphes den dienergountai toso pia ston dromo oso sta koinonika diktua. Semera, to na einai kaneis akatamakhetos kai na diktuonetai den basizetai pleon se kapoia parokhemene polesiake strategike e se lektikes akrobasies - basizetai se ESAS. Anakalupste to pos na entopisete ta semantika, na uperbeite te neurikoteta sas kai na moirasteite to prosopiko menuma sas me tropo suntomo, mesto kai paniskhuro."␀␀�@"␀␀�@"	
